OL,3,AWhat different world maps get right -
OL,4,Aand what they get wrong
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UN has just called for the
OL,7,Fpredominant world map to be replaced
OL,8,Fwith one that more accurately reflects
OL,9,Fthe true size of continents like
OL,10,FAfrica.
OL,12,FThe "Correct the Map" resolution
OL,13,Fadopted by the General Assembly aims to
OL,14,Ffix the discrepancy on the Mercator
OL,15,Fmap, in which the African continent is
OL,16,Fshown as being of similar size to
OL,17,FGreenland - even though it is in
OL,18,Freality about 14 times larger.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
