OL,3,AWhat different world maps get right -
OL,4,Aand what they get wrong
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt adopted a new map, the Equal Earth
OL,7,Fprojection, which better represents the
OL,8,Ftrue sizes of landmasses - but comes
OL,9,Fwith problems of its own.
OL,11,FThere have been many prominent attempts
OL,12,Fover the years to solve the problem of
OL,13,Faccurately representing the surface of
OL,14,Fa sphere on a flat rectangle, each with
OL,15,Fits own benefits and drawbacks.
